stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> Landed: IngestBatch
    Landed --> Processed: BuildSummaries + BuildIndex
    Processed --> FeaturesBuilt: ExtractFeatures (every active version)
    FeaturesBuilt --> Sealed: SealPartition (all current + grace period)
    Sealed --> Archived: lifecycle rule (tag sealed=true)
    Sealed --> Landed: late data (new generation)
    Archived --> Resealed: late data
    Resealed --> Archived: seal_version + 1
    Archived --> [*]: retention cutoff (>= 15 years)
